    <!-- lameta-source {"folderType":"session","folderId":"INT_2018_0073","fieldKey":"description"} -->
    <Description>Nnamdi Gómez talks about the shadow of a canvas that was never painted. There is a long passage about a single brush, which the artist calls "the elder".</Description>
